Package: seirstrata
Title: Age- and Region-Stratified SEIR Transmission Model with Immunity Strata
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Gunnar", "Rø", email = "gunnarroe@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Deterministic (ODE) and stochastic (tau-leaping) SEIR transmission
    models with hospitalisation and deaths, stratified by age group, region and
    level of immunity. Models are written in odin2 and run with dust2; the
    built-in observation model gives a likelihood for fitting with monty.
    Derived from the 'seirvax' preparedness-exercise package.
